  "slug": "javis-really-real-mexican-ceviche",
  "name": "Javi's Really Real Mexican Ceviche",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Shrimp and scallop ceviche is easy to make at home. The shellfish \"cook\" in a citrus marinade, resulting in an impressive entr\u00e9e or appetizer.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large glass or ceramic bowl, gently toss shrimp and scallops with lime juice and lemon juice. Mix in onion, cucumber, tomato, jalape\u00f1o, serrano, cilantro, olive oil, salt, and pepper. Cover the bowl and chill in the refrigerator until shrimp and scallops are opaque, about 1 hour."
    }
  ],
